{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:28:09.956Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"8e44c177d404faaccfcac65c","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-29T18:28:09.956Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-29T18:28:09.956Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Implementation evidence: the public SDK now exposes a versioned corpus-shape schema and five deterministic built-ins (scratch, representative, deep-graph, multi-decade, disconnected-archive). The generator materializes authors, schema customizations, annotations, typed edges, history depth, time span, parents and disconnected archives, emits measured shape manifests, and fails closed on declaration drift. A committed same-count scratch-versus-representative report compares claim/context/create/get/list/next/search p95 with a declared 20 percent materiality margin."}]}],"before_hash":"3fc8400d48af2f7d40be14ed396fc215932140e9611e748b75200574f7a59764","after_hash":"61e70f70cb61a3048f7d46be518ff9f2f73a62b0db8f4767298607563ec4fcad"}
